@TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241
@token = <access_token>

### Добавить валюту
POST {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "USD", "name": "Доллар США", "rate": 92.5 }

### Список валют
GET {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Получить валюту
GET {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies/<id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Изменить валюту
PUT {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies/<id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rate": 93.1 }

### Удалить валюту
DELETE {{TrueCode.Finance_HostAddress}}/currencies/<id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
